        "facts": ["Negative feedback reverses a change.", "The hypothalamus controls body temperature.", "Sweating and widened skin blood vessels lose heat; shivering produces heat."],
        "misconceptions": ["Negative feedback means a harmful response.", "Sweat cools the body because it comes out cold."] },
